{"unit_id":"d3vmeh__dsh-llm-gate#card-zh","repo":"d3vmeh/dsh-llm-gate","commit":"2a7acb42a7dd104a967e75778270a17b160f9106","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-gate（DSH 插件，模型服务集成）：按提供方限制模型请求并在 DSH 内排队，适合本地模型服务或其他并发容量有限的提供方。它接入 llm/stream，在发起下游请求前获取并发槽位；超出的请求按 FIFO 等待。可配置并发上限、等待队列容量和等待超时，支持取消等待，并在流结束后释放槽位。适合主 agent、子 agent 等请求可能重叠的场景。使用前需要启用 DSH 的 llm 服务，并为目标提供方配置 maxConcurrent。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:6-14","src/index.js:114-158"]}
{"unit_id":"d3vmeh__dsh-llm-gate#card-en","repo":"d3vmeh/dsh-llm-gate","commit":"2a7acb42a7dd104a967e75778270a17b160f9106","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-llm-gate limits DSH model requests per provider. It hooks llm/stream and queues excess requests FIFO. Configure concurrency, queue capacity, and wait timeout. Queued work supports cancellation; streams release slots when finished. Enable DSH llm and set maxConcurrent per provider.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:6-14","src/index.js:114-158"]}
