{"unit_id":"d3vmeh__dsh-llm-gate#feature-1","repo":"d3vmeh/dsh-llm-gate","commit":"2a7acb42a7dd104a967e75778270a17b160f9106","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-gate 的功能「提供方并发限制」：为配置的每个提供方建立独立并发门控，达到 maxConcurrent 后的新请求等待，不在配置中的提供方直接继续调用下游。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:24-42","src/index.js:114-134"]}
{"unit_id":"d3vmeh__dsh-llm-gate#feature-2","repo":"d3vmeh/dsh-llm-gate","commit":"2a7acb42a7dd104a967e75778270a17b160f9106","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-gate 的功能「FIFO 请求队列」：并发槽位释放后按进入顺序唤醒等待请求；可设置 maxQueued，队列达到上限时返回 QUEUE_FULL。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:44-65","src/index.js:68-88"]}
{"unit_id":"d3vmeh__dsh-llm-gate#feature-3","repo":"d3vmeh/dsh-llm-gate","commit":"2a7acb42a7dd104a967e75778270a17b160f9106","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-gate 的功能「等待超时与取消」：排队请求可按 queueTimeoutMs 超时并返回 QUEUE_TIMEOUT，也可由请求 abort signal 取消并从队列移除。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:47-65","src/index.js:78-88"]}
{"unit_id":"d3vmeh__dsh-llm-gate#feature-4","repo":"d3vmeh/dsh-llm-gate","commit":"2a7acb42a7dd104a967e75778270a17b160f9106","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-gate 的功能「流结束后释放槽位」：获取槽位后才调用下游流；无论流正常结束还是异常退出，finally 都释放槽位并让后续请求继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:131-158"]}
